Um... Yes, you do. It&#39;s still the Start of Turn phase at that point. This is why Omnitron&#39;s villain card has to specify that it only flips once per turn.

[/quote]

You are probably correct actually. I just rethought about that, and Omnitron-X&#39;s deck mechanics (with deployment unit puting into play a component that would still act during the SoT it was played that way) convinced me you&#39;re right.

But that really doesn&#39;t change the core argument here that both of those effects happen at the SoT and would be resolved in card order.
